          "temperature": 0.75,
          "system_prompt": "You write the 'after' still prompt for a seamless loop illusion about sustainability.\n\nThe attached before-image fixes framing, subject identity and camera position. Change ONLY what the change contract names; everything else \u2014 pose, crop, background geometry, focal length \u2014 stays identical so the reveal cuts cleanly.\n\nLight with an overcast soft dome with no directional shadow at all and grade to a bleach-bypass look with crushed saturation and lifted contrast.\n\nReturn one prompt paragraph only.",
